    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216-a1">

                <pb facs="0651" n="593" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg593"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of the President</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-12-27"><hi rendition="#small-caps">December</hi> 27,
                            1865</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">General</hi>: It was with sincere regret that I
                    recently received your letter of recall. I need not say, therefore, that it is
                    with sincere satisfaction that I now receive the letter which accredits you
                    again as envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of the United States
                    of Colombia to this government.</p>
                <p>I renew on this occasion my former assurance of friendship and good will to your
                    countrymen and to your country, and of personal esteem to yourself.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
